<title>USA: Rent-A-Wreck of America Inc Q3 shr down.</title>
<headline>Rent-A-Wreck of America Inc Q3 shr down.</headline>
<dateline>OWINGS MILLS, Md. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months		Nine months</p>
<p>				  ended Dec. 31,	 ended Dec. 31,</p>
<p>					1996     1995     1996     1995</p>
<p>(in thousands except per share and number of franchises)</p>
<p> Total Revenue		     797	892    2,857    2,669</p>
<p> Net income			   95	124	480	434</p>
<p> Earnings per share		.01	.02	.08	.07</p>
<p>Weighted average number of</p>
<p>  shares outstanding	   4,387    4,386    4,387    4,386</p>
<p>NOTE - Earnings per common share are after deducting a provision for preferred dividends of $32,565 and $98,795 for the three- and nine-month periods ended Dec. 31, 1995. For the three- and nine-month periods ended Dec. 31, 1996, earnings per common share are after deducting a provision for preferred dividends of $29,975 and $90,865.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
